\section{Conclusion}\label{sec:conclusion}

NER exhibits oracle scaling ($c{\approx}0.5$) but aggregation fails above $\theta_{\text{crit}}{=}0.70$; entity construction and LP selection ($+0.4$\textendash$1.4$\,pp) bypass the introspection boundary (AUROC $0.63$\textendash$0.88$ vs.\ ESJ $0.51$) rather than resolve it.
For configurations with small sample sizes (e.g., SQL $n{=}196$), absence of significant improvement may reflect insufficient statistical power rather than true absence of effect.

